-    "body": "{\n  \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/releases/400239551\",\n  \"assets_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/releases/400239551/assets\",\n  \"upload_url\": \"https://uploads.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/releases/400239551/assets{?name,label}\",\n  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/releases/tag/v0.13.0\",\n  \"id\": 400239551,\n  \"author\": {\n    \"login\": \"joffrey-bion\",\n    \"id\": 1913296,\n    \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTMyOTY=\",\n    \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1913296?v=4\",\n    \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/joffrey-bion\",\n    \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/followers\",\n    \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/following{/other_user}\",\n    \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/gists{/gist_id}\",\n    \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n    \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/subscriptions\",\n    \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/orgs\",\n    \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/repos\",\n    \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/events{/privacy}\",\n    \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/joffrey-bion/received_events\",\n    \"type\": \"User\",\n    \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n    \"site_admin\": false\n  },\n  \"node_id\": \"RE_kwDOSaggTs4X2yu_\",\n  \"tag_name\": \"v0.13.0\",\n  \"target_commitish\": \"main\",\n  \"name\": \"0.13.0\",\n  \"draft\": false,\n  \"immutable\": true,\n  \"prerelease\": false,\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T00:33:56Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-01T15:25:02Z\",\n  \"published_at\": \"2026-10-01T06:36:56Z\",\n  \"assets\": [\n\n  ],\n  \"tarball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/tarball/v0.13.0\",\n  \"zipball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/zipball/v0.13.0\",\n  \"body\": \"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/compare/v0.12.2...v0.13.0\\r\\n\\r\\nStay tuned for our release blog post, which will present the highlights.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Breaking changes\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-5543](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5543) — Rename AMPER_BUILD_DIR env var to KOTLIN_TOOLCHAIN_BUILD_DIR\\r\\n* [KTC-5733](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5733) — Update default Kotlin version to 2.4.20\\r\\n* [KTC-5853](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5853) — Don't hardcode the namespace for Android libraries\\r\\n* [KTC-5856](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5856) — Fail build with clear diagnostic when namespace or applicationId is missing in module.yaml \\r\\n* [KTC-5952](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5952) — Update default Compose version to 1.12.1\\r\\n* [KTC-5953](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5953) — Update default Ktor version to 3.6.0\\r\\n* [KTC-5954](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5954) — Update default Spring Boot version to 4.1.1\\r\\n* [KTC-5955](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5955) — Update default KSP version to 2.3.12\\r\\n* [KTC-5956](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5956) — Update default kotlinx.rpc version to 0.10.4\\r\\n* [KTC-5957](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5957) — Update default Lombok version to 1.18.48\\r\\n* [KTC-5972](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5972) — Rename the 'amper' module layout to 'default'\\r\\n\\r\\n### New features\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-679](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-679) — Check and/or provision Xcode components automatically\\r\\n* [KTC-3585](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-3585) — Support consuming Compose Resources from published libraries\\r\\n* [KTC-4627](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4627) — Support JUnit tags for test filtering\\r\\n* [KTC-5422](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5422) — Support Kotlin Native compiler caches in Kotlin Toolchain\\r\\n* [KTC-5478](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5478) — Support KMP wizard with Kotlin Toolchain CLI\\r\\n* [KTC-5549](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5549) — SwiftPM Initial Support\\r\\n* [KTC-5576](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5576) — Add testing of wasm modules\\r\\n* [KTC-5698](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5698) — Support publication of composeResources as a part of KMP library publication\\r\\n* [KTC-5784](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5784) — Reproducible JARs on clean rebuild\\r\\n* [KTC-5787](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5787) — Support `settings.kotlin.explicitApi` property and ignore it for test sources\\r\\n* [KTC-5832](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5832) — SwiftPM metadata is not published with kmp library\\r\\n* [KTC-5897](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5897) — Support explicit Android ABI filtering for application packaging\\r\\n* [KTC-5915](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5915) — Allow using dependencies from version catalog in `mavenPlugins(.dependencies)`\\r\\n\\r\\n### Cosmetics\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-610](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-610) — Add a skin to the Android emulator created by Kotlin Toolchain\\r\\n* [KTC-5820](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5820) — SwiftPM import: Suppress verbose errors about unsupported modules from swift package \\r\\n* [KTC-5883](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5883) — Add a user-friendly error for dumpSwiftPMDependencyResolution\\r\\n\\r\\n### Usability improvements\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-609](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-609) — Kotlin Toolchain installs Android SDK with non-canonical name (Amper-33)\\r\\n* [KTC-4232](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4232) — Unify test output for different platforms in `pretty` (default) format\\r\\n* [KTC-4240](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4240) — Compiler warnings are shown as error logs (and in stderr) for native compilations\\r\\n* [KTC-4720](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4720) — Running ios app fails with \\\"Found no destinations for the scheme 'app' and action build\\\"\\r\\n* [KTC-4791](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4791) — Compiler warnings are shown as error logs (and in stderr) for JS and Wasm compilations\\r\\n* [KTC-4801](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4801) — Always print the full stacktrace of Internal errors\\r\\n* [KTC-5233](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5233) — Warning from Kotlin native compiler about using Unsafe API\\r\\n* [KTC-5479](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5479) — iOS: dependency Compose resources not bundled unless `compose: enabled` on the app module (MissingResourceException at runtime)\\r\\n* [KTC-5695](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5695) — Supported way to accept the Android SDK license without sdkmanager\\r\\n* [KTC-5777](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5777) — `kotlin run --module` with a non-app module should fail more clearly\\r\\n* [KTC-5785](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5785) — Prompt for single module selection in `show settings/dependencies` instead of multiple\\r\\n* [KTC-5816](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5816) — Hide '+zcm' is not a recognized feature error message\\r\\n* [KTC-5821](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5821) — Report progress of downloading tools, sdks, etc in the CLI\\r\\n* [KTC-5824](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5824) — Improve Compose Hot Reload discoverability in the CLI\\r\\n* [KTC-5830](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5830) — Unable to consume kmp library published to maven local with default settings\\r\\n* [KTC-5879](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5879) — If kotlin clean fails with Internal Error then stacktrace is unavailable\\r\\n* [KTC-5979](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5979) — Make `languageVersion` and `apiVersion` strings instead of enums\\r\\n\\r\\n### Fixed bugs\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-4789](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4789) — js/wasmjs linking failure \\r\\n* [KTC-5434](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5434) — Kotlin Toolchain generated AAR manifests missing `<uses-sdk>` cause spurious WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission\\r\\n* [KTC-5602](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5602) — KSP fails with Room when building via Kotlin Toolchain \\r\\n* [KTC-5645](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5645) — CLI hangs forever when a KSP task fails\\r\\n* [KTC-5651](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5651) — Rename: update Xcode project in templates\\r\\n* [KTC-5686](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5686) — Executable JAR is broken with `settings.spring: enabled`\\r\\n* [KTC-5765](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5765) — IOException: Resource deadlock would occur\\r\\n* [KTC-5770](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5770) — Ctrl+C on WASM APP throws IllegalStateException: Shutdown in progress\\r\\n* [KTC-5776](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5776) — Compose 1.12.0 doesn't work (new skiko artifacts)\\r\\n* [KTC-5778](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5778) — 100% cache miss on executable jar creation\\r\\n* [KTC-5779](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5779) — Dependency classifier is ignored if dependency is published with Gradle module metadata\\r\\n* [KTC-5790](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5790) — Dependency resolution step hangs in IDE\\r\\n* [KTC-5795](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5795) — Incremental build does not restore deleted output .class files — kotlin run reports successful compilation but fails with ClassNotFoundException\\r\\n* [KTC-5797](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5797) — kmp/lib: settings.kotlin.serialization adds kotlinx-serialization-core to the POM once per fragment  \\r\\n* [KTC-5845](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5845) — Do not require to set `description` module property for publishing to Maven Central if `description` property in POM is already set\\r\\n* [KTC-5850](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5850) — K/Wasm: Process page errors during browser testing\\r\\n* [KTC-5860](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5860) — Compose Hot Reload prints a lot of empty lines during the reload\\r\\n* [KTC-5866](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5866) — Sporadic failures of Room: \\\"Failed to delete old native lib ... sqlitejdbc.dll\\\"\\r\\n* [KTC-5869](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5869) — Android run fails with internal error: AdbCommandRejectedException\\r\\n* [KTC-5875](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5875) — WasmJS and WasmWASI expose types from non-exported transitive dependencies\\r\\n* [KTC-5885](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5885) — Deprecated -Xwasm and -Xir-produce-klib-file flags are used for Wasm targets\\r\\n* [KTC-5896](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5896) — Dependency resolution sometimes produces a graph that includes the same library of two different versions\\r\\n* [KTC-5921](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5921) — `kotlin run` hangs indefinitely for Android application on clean cache on Windows\\r\\n* [KTC-5926](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5926) — Simulator window not opening with Xcode 27.0+\\r\\n* [KTC-5933](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5933) — Android library packages composeResources twice in (assets/ and inside the bundled jar)\\r\\n* [KTC-5935](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5935) — Android AAR silently drops Compose resource overrides from refined fragments\\r\\n* [KTC-5938](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5938) — ClassCastException while editing swift package dependency\\r\\n* [KTC-5940](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5940) — Common tests run for few random targets with KTC 0.13.0\\r\\n* [KTC-5950](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5950) — Hot reload fails with IllegalArgumentException in @DevelopmentEntryPoint preview in kmp/lib modules\\r\\n* [KTC-5960](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5960) — Android namespace fallback doesn't respect artifactId fallback\\r\\n* [KTC-5973](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5973) — Wrapper errors can lead to corrupted CLI distribution cache\\r\\n\\r\\n### IDE Improvements\\r\\n\\r\\nThese changes are available in the [Kotlin Toolchain plugin](https://plugins.jetbrains.com/plugin/31850-kotlin-toolchain) for IntelliJ IDEA 2026.2.3.\\r\\n\\r\\n#### New features\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-5590](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5590) — Debug Android unit tests\\r\\n* [KTC-5742](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5742) — Track local packages in IDE and rerun cinterops when manifests or sources change\\r\\n\\r\\n#### Cosmetics\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-5914](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5914) — Generated run configurations have verbose prefix \\\"Module \\\"\\r\\n\\r\\n#### Usability improvements\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-951](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-951) — The default android-app run configuration is not helpful if Android SDK is absent\\r\\n* [KTC-5512](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5512) — IDE automatically comments out inserted `//`-paths\\r\\n* [KTC-5812](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5812) — Improve Compose Hot Reload discoverability in the IDE\\r\\n* [KTC-5909](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5909) — Create run configurations earlier during the sync\\r\\n* [KTC-5910](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5910) — Create run configurations for iOS and Android apps if the KMP plugin is absent\\r\\n\\r\\n#### Fixed bugs\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-5710](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5710) — Auto-sync does not work in Android Studio\\r\\n* [KTC-5716](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5716) — Cannot run parameterized test method with a nested class as parameter type\\r\\n* [KTC-5764](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5764) — Android live edit infinity update in AS Rabbit\\r\\n* [KTC-5774](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5774) — Pasting Gradle-style dependencies doesn't add $ for catalog libs\\r\\n* [KTC-5786](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5786) — Pasting Gradle-style dependencies only works after '- '\\r\\n* [KTC-5813](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5813) — Odd file tree when traversing from Gradle to KTC project\\r\\n* [KTC-5828](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5828) — Open new KTC project from IDE wizard - androidApp run configuration is broken: Cannot obtain the package\\r\\n* [KTC-5849](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5849) — WasmJS main run gutter is missing when Kotlin Multiplatform IDEA plugin is disabled\\r\\n* [KTC-5903](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5903) — The Kotlin Toolchain IDE plugin is broken in IDEA 2026.2.3\",\n  \"reactions\": {\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/releases/400239551/reactions\",\n    \"total_count\": 11,\n    \"+1\": 0,\n    \"-1\": 0,\n    \"laugh\": 0,\n    \"hooray\": 5,\n    \"confused\": 0,\n    \"heart\": 0,\n    \"rocket\": 6,\n    \"eyes\": 0\n  }\n}\n"
