ets\": [\n\n  ],\n  \"tarball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/tarball/v0.13.0\",\n  \"zipball_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/zipball/v0.13.0\",\n  \"body\": \"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin-toolchain/compare/v0.12.2...v0.13.0\\r\\n\\r\\nStay tuned for our release blog post, which will present the highlights.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Breaking changes\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-5543](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5543) — Rename AMPER_BUILD_DIR env var to KOTLIN_TOOLCHAIN_BUILD_DIR\\r\\n* [KTC-5733](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5733) — Update default Kotlin version to 2.4.20\\r\\n* [KTC-5853](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5853) — Don't hardcode the namespace for Android libraries\\r\\n* [KTC-5856](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5856) — Fail build with clear diagnostic when namespace or applicationId is missing in module.yaml \\r\\n* [KTC-5952](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5952) — Update default Compose version to 1.12.1\\r\\n* [KTC-5953](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5953) — Update default Ktor version to 3.6.0\\r\\n* [KTC-5954](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5954) — Update default Spring Boot version to 4.1.1\\r\\n* [KTC-5955](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5955) — Update default KSP version to 2.3.12\\r\\n* [KTC-5956](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5956) — Update default kotlinx.rpc version to 0.10.4\\r\\n* [KTC-5957](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5957) — Update default Lombok version to 1.18.48\\r\\n* [KTC-5972](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5972) — Rename the 'amper' module layout to 'default'\\r\\n\\r\\n### New features\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-679](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-679) — Check and/or provision Xcode components automatically\\r\\n* [KTC-3585](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-3585) — Support consuming Compose Resources from published libraries\\r\\n* [KTC-4627](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4627) — Support JUnit tags for test filtering\\r\\n* [KTC-5422](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5422) — Support Kotlin Native compiler caches in Kotlin Toolchain\\r\\n* [KTC-5478](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5478) — Support KMP wizard with Kotlin Toolchain CLI\\r\\n* [KTC-5549](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5549) — SwiftPM Initial Support\\r\\n* [KTC-5576](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5576) — Add testing of wasm modules\\r\\n* [KTC-5698](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5698) — Support publication of composeResources as a part of KMP library publication\\r\\n* [KTC-5784](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5784) — Reproducible JARs on clean rebuild\\r\\n* [KTC-5787](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5787) — Support `settings.kotlin.explicitApi` property and ignore it for test sources\\r\\n* [KTC-5832](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5832) — SwiftPM metadata is not published with kmp library\\r\\n* [KTC-5897](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5897) — Support explicit Android ABI filtering for application packaging\\r\\n* [KTC-5915](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5915) — Allow using dependencies from version catalog in `mavenPlugins(.dependencies)`\\r\\n\\r\\n### Cosmetics\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-610](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-610) — Add a skin to the Android emulator created by Kotlin Toolchain\\r\\n* [KTC-5820](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5820) — SwiftPM import: Suppress verbose errors about unsupported modules from swift package \\r\\n* [KTC-5883](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5883) — Add a user-friendly error for dumpSwiftPMDependencyResolution\\r\\n\\r\\n### Usability improvements\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-609](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-609) — Kotlin Toolchain installs Android SDK with non-canonical name (Amper-33)\\r\\n* [KTC-4232](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4232) — Un