ith Internal Error then stacktrace is unavailable\\r\\n* [KTC-5979](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5979) — Make `languageVersion` and `apiVersion` strings instead of enums\\r\\n\\r\\n### Fixed bugs\\r\\n\\r\\n* [KTC-4789](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-4789) — js/wasmjs linking failure \\r\\n* [KTC-5434](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5434) — Kotlin Toolchain generated AAR manifests missing `<uses-sdk>` cause spurious WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission\\r\\n* [KTC-5602](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5602) — KSP fails with Room when building via Kotlin Toolchain \\r\\n* [KTC-5645](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5645) — CLI hangs forever when a KSP task fails\\r\\n* [KTC-5651](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5651) — Rename: update Xcode project in templates\\r\\n* [KTC-5686](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5686) — Executable JAR is broken with `settings.spring: enabled`\\r\\n* [KTC-5765](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5765) — IOException: Resource deadlock would occur\\r\\n* [KTC-5770](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5770) — Ctrl+C on WASM APP throws IllegalStateException: Shutdown in progress\\r\\n* [KTC-5776](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5776) — Compose 1.12.0 doesn't work (new skiko artifacts)\\r\\n* [KTC-5778](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5778) — 100% cache miss on executable jar creation\\r\\n* [KTC-5779](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5779) — Dependency classifier is ignored if dependency is published with Gradle module metadata\\r\\n* [KTC-5790](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5790) — Dependency resolution step hangs in IDE\\r\\n* [KTC-5795](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5795) — Incremental build does not restore deleted output .class files — kotlin run reports successful compilation but fails with ClassNotFoundException\\r\\n* [KTC-5797](https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issue/KTC-5797) — kmp/lib: settings.kotlin.serializati